 r←Test_Input_Misc_026(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;parms;F;menubar
⍝ Exercise "Input" with a single label that is a URL.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 defMat⍪←'URL' '' '<https://github.com/aplteam>'DT.Label

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.testMode←1
 n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.Create defMat parms ⍬
 →GoToTidyUp n.URL.FCol≢0 0 255
 →GoToTidyUp 600≠n.URL.FontObj.Weight
 →GoToTidyUp 1≠n.URL.FontObj.Underline
 →GoToTidyUp'https://'≢{⍺ ⍺⍺(⍴,⍺)↑⍵}n.URL.Caption
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ {}n.∆CloseForm ⋄ :EndTrap
⍝Done
